                <article class="administrator-setting-card administrator-reveal"><span class="administrator-setting-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5h16v14H4V5Zm0 2 8 6 8-6"/></svg></span><div><h3>Email Notifications</h3><p>No email notification service is connected.</p></div><span class="administrator-setting-status">Not configured</span></article>
                <article class="administrator-setting-card administrator-reveal"><span class="administrator-setting-icon administrator-setting-icon--success"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="8" ry="3"/><path d="M4 5v7c0 2 4 3 8 3s8-1 8-3V5M4 12v7c0 2 4 3 8 3s8-1 8-3v-7"/></svg></span><div><h3>Database Data</h3><p>This page loaded users, products, applications and orders.</p></div><span class="administrator-setting-status administrator-setting-status--success">Connected</span></article>
                <article class="administrator-setting-card administrator-reveal"><span class="administrator-setting-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v12m-4-4 4 4 4-4M5 21h14"/></svg></span><div><h3>Backup Workflow</h3><p>No backup endpoint is implemented in this version.</p></div><span class="administrator-setting-status">Not configured</span></article>
                <article class="administrator-setting-card administrator-reveal"><span class="administrator-setting-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 8v5m0 3h.01"/></svg></span><div><h3>Application</h3><p>Campus Coffee ASP.NET Core MVC.</p></div><span class="administrator-setting-status">Development</span></article>
                <article class="administrator-setting-card administrator-reveal"><span class="administrator-setting-icon administrator-setting-icon--success"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 10V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v3M5 10h14v11H5V10Z"/></svg></span><div><h3>Role Protection</h3><p>This dashboard requires the Administrator role.</p></div><span class="administrator-setting-status administrator-setting-status--success">Enforced</span></article>
